{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021173954037-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021180242\"/><p>今晨(21日)11時27分，執法部門接獲市民報案，指其47歲尼泊爾籍男友人失聯，擔心對方發生意外。警員根據報案人提供的資料，登上事主位於油麻地佐敦道37號的住所查看，發現他倒臥在屋內一房間，已經返魂乏術。事主的死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.596473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:39:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:41.407617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:41.407617+00:00","content_hash":"4d8a927d633e9c1b617f41622cf77ba3d1f67fa21371d0956c07a09bd0975f31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}